# Calendar pages

Schedule grids (month/week). Mirror **`/team/my-shifts`** (`useShiftSchedulePage` + `shift-calendar`). Template CRUD stays on the list route.

## Rules

- Hook → stateless schedule page → route with **page scroll** (no `TablePageViewport`)
- Calendar primitives may own local month/week navigation only
- Assign/delete via shared form modals / confirm; honor shift location write checks
- Feature schedule skeleton — not `TableSkeleton`
- Keep list CRUD (`shift-templates`) and calendar (`my-shifts`) as separate pages

See `.docs/components/calendar-pages.md`.
